  "details": "1. Load this world: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_0e6bac6c-2a2a-498f-ac57-4fe7e80bfd83/info\n\n2. Zoom your 3rd-person camera out all the way\n\n3. Notice that you can see the galaxy skybox\n\n4. Turn your camera 90 degrees\n\n5. Notice that the camera now stays *inside* of the room\n\n6. Continue turning at will; notice that when a \"default layer\" wall is at your back, the camera is inside the room, but when a \"custom layer\" wall is at your back, the camera can see the skybox",
